- Use strong, unique passwords for all accounts and change them frequently; 
- Use two-factor or multi-factor authentication whenever possible; 
- Lock down your Wi-Fi with a strong password; 
- Install and update antivirus and anti-malware software; 
- Back up your data regularly; 
- Disable any unnecessary or public-facing services; and 
- Stay up to date on the latest security patches and best practices.
